<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Juzaki</title>
  <style>
    * {
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      box-sizing: border-box;
    }

    body {
      min-height: 100vh;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, sans-serif;
      background: #0f0f12;
      color: #e8e8ed;
    }

    .card {
      text-align: center;
      padding: 2.5rem 2rem;
      max-width: 420px;
    }

    h1 {
      font-size: 2.25rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: -0.03em;
      margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
    }

    p {
      color: #9a9aa8;
      font-size: 1.05rem;
      line-height: 1.5;
      margin-bottom: 1.75rem;
    }

    .badge {
      display: inline-block;
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      color: #7c7c8a;
      background: #1a1a22;
      border: 1px solid #2a2a35;
      border-radius: 999px;
      padding: 0.35rem 0.9rem;
    }

    a {
      color: #a78bfa;
      text-decoration: none;
    }

    a:hover {
      text-decoration: underline;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="card">
    <h1>Juzaki</h1>
    <p>Sitio en construcción. Pronto habrá más contenido aquí.</p>
    <span class="badge">juzaki.is-a.dev</span>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
